{
  "name": "combat_siege",
  "description": "[P07]'s own demonstration run. Builds a heated, walled, four-barrel city and then throws the whole roster at it one kind at a time, so every enemy's answer and every weapon's trade-off shows up in one metrics.csv. Read turret_uptime against heat_spent_on_defence: the guns only fire while the grid is feeding them. Not part of the shared library in tests/scenarios/ on purpose \u2014 it is a part-owned fixture, run with --scenario=res://tests/combat/combat_siege.json.",
